7, child: Text('N', style: TextStyle(fontSize: 13, fontWeight: FontWeight.bold))),
        const Positioned(right: 15, bottom: 20, child: Text('09.21 00:19', style: TextStyle(fontSize: 11))),
      ],
    ),
  );

  List<Widget> _minimapDots() {
    final out = <Widget>[];
    const radius = 80.0;
    for (final n in _npcVisuals.take(80)) {
      final dx = n.placement.position.x - character.x, dz = n.placement.position.z - character.z;
      if (dx.abs() > radius || dz.abs() > radius) continue;
      final x = 102 + dx / radius * 72, y = 109 + dz / radius * 72;
      out.add(
        Positioned(
          left: x,
          top: y,
          child: Container(
            width: 5,
            height: 5,
            decoration: BoxDecoration(
              color: n.definition.startQuestIds.isNotEmpty ? const Color(0xffffff2b) : const Color(0xffff6945),
              shape: BoxShape.circle,
              border: Border.all(color: Colors.black, width: .5),
            ),
          ),
        ),
      );
    }
    out.add(
      Positioned(
        left: 100,
        top: 107,
        child: Transform.rotate(
          angle: scene.character?.root.rotation.y ?? 0,
          child: const Icon(Icons.navigation, size: 10, color: Colors.white),
        ),
      ),
    );
    return out;
  }

